        "Snow fills the names faster than you can brush it away. You stop trying after the third.",
        "The gate squeals whenever the wind moves it. The dead have heard worse.",
        "Someone left a wooden cup beside a grave. It has caught years of snow and not much else."
      ],
      park: [
        "Trees have split the old paths apart. Nature came back with a grudge and plenty of time.",
        "A bench faces a frozen pond. The view is terrible. You sit for a moment anyway.",
